  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Terra Sancta Museum : Heritage Education Hub for Palestinian Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective is to contribute to the preservation of the Palestinian character of the Old City of Jerusalem, its cultural heritage and identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objective is to activate a heritage and education hub for the Palestinian community that will contribute to supporting the preservation and understanding of the Palestinian cultural heritage, increasing ownership, enhancing engagement among CBOs and citizens&#xbf; representatives, and offering learning and fun opportunities strengthening the resilience of Palestinian living in East Jerusalem.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
